   "source": [
    "# Commodity Price Forecasting AI Agent\n",
    "## Notebook 06 - XGBoost Forecasting Model\n",
    "\n",
    "### Objective\n",
    "This notebook develops an XGBoost regression model to predict silver closing prices using engineered features. The model is evaluated using regression metrics and its predictions are exported for comparison with other forecasting models.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Project:**Project 1D\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** Ananya Bivare\n",
    "\n",
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "9cf6379c-5575-481f-a6fb-1bef6539aa06",
   "metadata": {},
